      "excerpt": "The cryptographic core of ArkenForge. ECDSA signature verification, did:key identity, nonce generation. What this is arken-core is the Rust library that everything in ArkenForge builds on. It handles: Challenge generation — cryptographically random nonces with 60s TTL Signature verification — ECDSA secp256k1 via ethers-rs DID parsing — did:key identity using the W3C spec (zQ3s… prefix for secp256k1) It compiles to a native shared library (.dylib / .so / .dll) loaded by higher-level packages via FFI. Build Requires Rust. cd rust cargo build --release Output: rust/target/release/libarken_core.{d",
